<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:24.235" end="00:00:28.220" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:00:26.200" end="00:00:28.220" style="s2">[crying]</p>
<p begin="00:00:31.200" end="00:00:35.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is a disgrace.</p>
<p begin="00:00:33.800" end="00:00:38.300" style="s2">A beggar.</p>
<p begin="00:00:35.500" end="00:00:40.800" style="s2">A beggar touching the Princess Rose.</p>
<p begin="00:00:38.300" end="00:00:40.800" style="s2">Seize him!</p>
<p begin="00:01:47.200" end="00:01:50.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lips tremble.</p>
<p begin="00:01:51.200" end="00:01:56.300" style="s2">The doctors say I won&#39;t see the winter,</p>
<p begin="00:01:53.800" end="00:01:56.300" style="s2">Elena.</p>
<p begin="00:01:57.246" end="00:01:59.266" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:02:01.600" end="00:02:05.492" style="s2">Before I I want to see you married.</p>
<p begin="00:02:11.192" end="00:02:15.992" style="s2">In seven days is the ceremony of the</p>
<p begin="00:02:13.092" end="00:02:15.992" style="s2">Golden Rose.</p>
<p begin="00:02:23.992" end="00:02:27.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You want me to marry whoever catches a</p>
<p begin="00:02:25.692" end="00:02:30.392" style="s2">rose?</p>
<p begin="00:02:27.592" end="00:02:32.792" style="s2">A man I don&#39;t even know?</p>
<p begin="00:02:30.392" end="00:02:34.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your mother threw the rose and I caught</p>
<p begin="00:02:32.792" end="00:02:38.592" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:02:34.892" end="00:02:40.292" style="s2">They were the happiest days of my life.</p>
<p begin="00:02:38.592" end="00:02:42.592" style="s2">The rose never chooses wrong, my</p>
<p begin="00:02:40.292" end="00:02:42.592" style="s2">daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:02:54.292" end="00:02:58.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why always her?</p>
<p begin="00:02:56.092" end="00:03:01.192" style="s2">Why can&#39;t I throw the rose? I&#39;m more</p>
<p begin="00:02:58.092" end="00:03:01.192" style="s2">beautiful than she is.</p>
<p begin="00:03:06.492" end="00:03:08.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; On the day of the ceremony, you will</p>
<p begin="00:03:07.592" end="00:03:10.292" style="s2">stand in the front row right under the</p>
<p begin="00:03:08.992" end="00:03:11.892" style="s2">balcony. You will catch the rose and</p>
<p begin="00:03:10.292" end="00:03:13.392" style="s2">marry Elena.</p>
<p begin="00:03:11.892" end="00:03:16.292" style="s2">And when the king dies,</p>
<p begin="00:03:13.392" end="00:03:16.292" style="s2">the kingdom is ours.</p>
<p begin="00:03:16.992" end="00:03:21.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And what if the rose flies somewhere</p>
<p begin="00:03:18.892" end="00:03:21.192" style="s2">else?</p>
<p begin="00:03:49.892" end="00:03:54.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If the queen finds out we left the</p>
<p begin="00:03:50.992" end="00:03:54.292" style="s2">palace, she&#39;ll have my head.</p>
<p begin="00:04:03.662" end="00:04:05.682" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [cheering]</p>
<p begin="00:04:06.594" end="00:04:09.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In seven days I&#39;ll be the wife of a</p>
<p begin="00:04:08.094" end="00:04:12.894" style="s2">stranger mirror.</p>
<p begin="00:04:09.494" end="00:04:12.894" style="s2">Let me live just one day freely.</p>
<p begin="00:04:19.894" end="00:04:22.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not ratting.</p>
<p begin="00:04:21.094" end="00:04:24.994" style="s2">I&#39;m going.</p>
<p begin="00:04:22.794" end="00:04:24.994" style="s2">Go hunt.</p>
<p begin="00:04:36.794" end="00:04:42.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HUNGER DOESN&#39;T MAKE YOU A THIEF.</p>
<p begin="00:04:38.994" end="00:04:42.694" style="s2">THE REAL THIEVES LIVE IN PALACES. GO.</p>
<p begin="00:04:49.494" end="00:04:54.294" style="s2">A precious bracelet</p>
<p begin="00:04:51.094" end="00:04:54.294" style="s2">for a girl who pretends to be poor.</p>
<p begin="00:05:00.648" end="00:05:02.668" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:05:05.233" end="00:05:07.253" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:05:08.694" end="00:05:11.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And who says I&#39;m pretending?</p>
<p begin="00:05:13.093" end="00:05:15.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:05:24.894" end="00:05:28.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your hands,</p>
<p begin="00:05:27.194" end="00:05:30.994" style="s2">they have never worked a single day in</p>
<p begin="00:05:28.494" end="00:05:30.994" style="s2">their life.</p>
<p begin="00:05:35.394" end="00:05:40.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And you?</p>
<p begin="00:05:37.194" end="00:05:40.094" style="s2">You give your last bread.</p>
<p begin="00:05:41.194" end="00:05:45.094" style="s2">You give your last bread to the thief</p>
<p begin="00:05:42.494" end="00:05:45.094" style="s2">who robbed me.</p>
<p begin="00:05:45.794" end="00:05:49.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He who owns nothing is not afraid to</p>
<p begin="00:05:47.094" end="00:05:49.694" style="s2">lose anything.</p>
<p begin="00:06:04.894" end="00:06:07.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who was that?</p>
<p begin="00:06:15.295" end="00:06:18.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know.</p>
<p begin="00:06:17.195" end="00:06:21.495" style="s2">But he&#39;s the first man who looked at me</p>
<p begin="00:06:18.495" end="00:06:21.495" style="s2">and didn&#39;t see the crown.</p>
<p begin="00:07:07.719" end="00:07:09.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:07:16.889" end="00:07:18.909" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:07:32.610" end="00:07:34.630" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:07:52.915" end="00:07:54.935" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:07:59.895" end="00:08:04.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is a disgrace.</p>
<p begin="00:08:02.495" end="00:08:06.997" style="s2">A beggar.</p>
<p begin="00:08:04.295" end="00:08:09.397" style="s2">A beggar touching the Princess Rose.</p>
<p begin="00:08:06.997" end="00:08:09.397" style="s2">Seize him!</p>
<p begin="00:09:04.397" end="00:09:08.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your Majesty, THIS THIEF ISN&#39;T EVEN</p>
<p begin="00:09:06.597" end="00:09:11.897" style="s2">WORTHY OF CLEANING YOUR STABLES.</p>
<p begin="00:09:08.897" end="00:09:11.897" style="s2">REPEAT THE RITUAL.</p>
<p begin="00:09:20.497" end="00:09:24.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; MY DEAR SISTER WILL be the queen of</p>
<p begin="00:09:22.197" end="00:09:24.797" style="s2">beggars.</p>
<p begin="00:09:26.581" end="00:09:29.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:09:27.997" end="00:09:30.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The law of the Rose is older than this</p>
<p begin="00:09:29.597" end="00:09:32.897" style="s2">palace.</p>
<p begin="00:09:30.897" end="00:09:35.597" style="s2">No one [music] breaks it,</p>
<p begin="00:09:32.897" end="00:09:35.597" style="s2">not even me.</p>
<p begin="00:09:46.097" end="00:09:48.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I accept.</p>
<p begin="00:09:52.781" end="00:09:54.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:09:55.897" end="00:09:58.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The girl from the market.</p>
<p begin="00:09:59.986" end="00:10:02.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:10:07.897" end="00:10:12.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The law has spoken, your Majesty.</p>
<p begin="00:10:10.397" end="00:10:13.998" style="s2">But the same law says a wife lives in</p>
<p begin="00:10:12.098" end="00:10:15.598" style="s2">her husband&#39;s house.</p>
<p begin="00:10:13.998" end="00:10:18.398" style="s2">And this man</p>
<p begin="00:10:15.598" end="00:10:18.398" style="s2">has no house here.</p>
<p begin="00:10:20.698" end="00:10:24.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Morgana,</p>
<p begin="00:10:22.698" end="00:10:26.098" style="s2">she is my daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:10:24.598" end="00:10:27.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That is exactly why you must respect the</p>
<p begin="00:10:26.098" end="00:10:28.698" style="s2">law.</p>
<p begin="00:10:27.198" end="00:10:32.198" style="s2">Otherwise the people will say the king</p>
<p begin="00:10:28.698" end="00:10:32.198" style="s2">breaks his own laws for his family.</p>
<p begin="00:10:39.287" end="00:10:41.307" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:10:54.352" end="00:10:56.372" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:10:59.598" end="00:11:05.298" style="s2">It suits me better, doesn&#39;t it?</p>
<p begin="00:11:01.598" end="00:11:05.298" style="s2">Enjoy your new palace of mud, sister.</p>
<p begin="00:11:11.098" end="00:11:15.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bread and honey</p>
<p begin="00:11:12.498" end="00:11:17.798" style="s2">and your comb. I can&#39;t give you more.</p>
<p begin="00:11:15.498" end="00:11:20.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stay by my father&#39;s side, Mira.</p>
<p begin="00:11:17.798" end="00:11:20.198" style="s2">Please.</p>
<p begin="00:11:23.172" end="00:11:25.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:11:30.398" end="00:11:32.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:11:31.798" end="00:11:34.698" style="s2">The road is long. You&#39;ll need my hand</p>
<p begin="00:11:32.998" end="00:11:36.198" style="s2">somewhere.</p>
<p begin="00:11:34.698" end="00:11:37.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t think I love you because I said</p>
<p begin="00:11:36.198" end="00:11:40.698" style="s2">yes.</p>
<p begin="00:11:37.898" end="00:11:42.198" style="s2">I said it so Morgana wouldn&#39;t win.</p>
<p begin="00:11:40.698" end="00:11:45.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:11:42.198" end="00:11:45.498" style="s2">That&#39;s exactly why I respect you.</p>
<p begin="00:11:47.408" end="00:11:49.428" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:11:54.198" end="00:11:56.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is your home.</p>
<p begin="00:11:57.498" end="00:12:01.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is our home.</p>
<p begin="00:11:59.598" end="00:12:04.098" style="s2">I&#39;ll sleep by the fire.</p>
<p begin="00:12:01.598" end="00:12:04.098" style="s2">The bed is yours.</p>
<p begin="00:12:06.403" end="00:12:08.423" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:12:10.333" end="00:12:14.318" style="s2">[cough]</p>
<p begin="00:12:12.298" end="00:12:14.318" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:12:16.883" end="00:12:18.903" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:12:24.599" end="00:12:28.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And the brave knight [music] never gave</p>
<p begin="00:12:27.199" end="00:12:30.638" style="s2">up.</p>
<p begin="00:12:28.099" end="00:12:32.658" style="s2">Not even when the dragon roared.</p>
<p begin="00:12:30.638" end="00:12:32.658" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:12:36.199" end="00:12:40.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your husband fixed my roof last winter</p>
<p begin="00:12:38.499" end="00:12:43.399" style="s2">and didn&#39;t take a penny.</p>
<p begin="00:12:40.999" end="00:12:46.599" style="s2">That man is poor in his pocket,</p>
<p begin="00:12:43.399" end="00:12:46.599" style="s2">but rich in his heart.</p>
<p begin="00:12:52.253" end="00:12:54.273" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:12:57.599" end="00:13:00.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A vagabond who reads Latin.</p>
<p begin="00:13:01.299" end="00:13:04.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Vagabonds have a lot of time.</p>
<p begin="00:13:07.099" end="00:13:13.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In the palace, I had a hundred dresses,</p>
<p begin="00:13:09.899" end="00:13:14.999" style="s2">and I was never happy for a single day.</p>
<p begin="00:13:13.199" end="00:13:16.899" style="s2">And here,</p>
<p begin="00:13:14.999" end="00:13:19.199" style="s2">I burn the bread every day, [music] and</p>
<p begin="00:13:16.899" end="00:13:20.499" style="s2">I laugh.</p>
<p begin="00:13:19.199" end="00:13:22.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Happiness doesn&#39;t live in palaces,</p>
<p begin="00:13:20.499" end="00:13:23.499" style="s2">Elena.</p>
<p begin="00:13:22.099" end="00:13:25.899" style="s2">It lives in the people you share burnt</p>
<p begin="00:13:23.499" end="00:13:25.899" style="s2">bread with.</p>
<p begin="00:13:30.244" end="00:13:32.264" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:13:53.499" end="00:13:59.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want to see Elena.</p>
<p begin="00:13:56.399" end="00:14:02.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elena chose her path, my love.</p>
<p begin="00:13:59.299" end="00:14:02.899" style="s2">Drink. This will ease you.</p>
<p begin="00:14:04.599" end="00:14:09.699" style="s2">In three days, at the crown feast, the</p>
<p begin="00:14:07.299" end="00:14:13.199" style="s2">king will sign that Salivi is his heir,</p>
<p begin="00:14:09.699" end="00:14:16.101" style="s2">and you, Victor, will marry her.</p>
<p begin="00:14:13.199" end="00:14:19.101" style="s2">And that same night,</p>
<p begin="00:14:16.101" end="00:14:19.101" style="s2">he will not wake up.</p>
<p begin="00:14:19.901" end="00:14:23.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mother,</p>
<p begin="00:14:21.401" end="00:14:26.501" style="s2">we kill him?</p>
<p begin="00:14:23.501" end="00:14:26.501" style="s2">He was kind to me.</p>
<p begin="00:14:26.801" end="00:14:32.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kind people don&#39;t become kings.</p>
<p begin="00:14:29.701" end="00:14:32.401" style="s2">Remember that.</p>
<p begin="00:14:32.470" end="00:14:34.490" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:14:40.330" end="00:14:42.350" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:15:09.601" end="00:15:13.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elena,</p>
<p begin="00:15:10.801" end="00:15:16.355" style="s2">the king isn&#39;t sick. Morgana is putting</p>
<p begin="00:15:13.101" end="00:15:18.375" style="s2">something in his wine every night.</p>
<p begin="00:15:16.355" end="00:15:18.375" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:15:23.301" end="00:15:26.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you go into the palace now, Victor&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:15:25.201" end="00:15:27.801" style="s2">guards will kill you before you reach</p>
<p begin="00:15:26.401" end="00:15:29.401" style="s2">the stairs.</p>
<p begin="00:15:27.801" end="00:15:32.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And what can you do?</p>
<p begin="00:15:29.401" end="00:15:32.301" style="s2">You&#39;re a vagabond.</p>
<p begin="00:15:38.101" end="00:15:41.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My name really is Rowan,</p>
<p begin="00:15:39.801" end="00:15:44.001" style="s2">but I&#39;m not a vagabond.</p>
<p begin="00:15:41.401" end="00:15:45.601" style="s2">I am Rowan, son of the king of Aldoria.</p>
<p begin="00:15:44.001" end="00:15:47.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A prince?</p>
<p begin="00:15:45.601" end="00:15:48.801" style="s2">You lied to me all this time?</p>
<p begin="00:15:47.701" end="00:15:51.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My father wanted me to marry the</p>
<p begin="00:15:48.801" end="00:15:52.901" style="s2">princess of Eltania. I told him,</p>
<p begin="00:15:51.101" end="00:15:55.901" style="s2">I won&#39;t marry a crown.</p>
<p begin="00:15:52.901" end="00:15:57.801" style="s2">I want to know who she is without it.</p>
<p begin="00:15:55.901" end="00:15:59.601" style="s2">Then I saw you in the market,</p>
<p begin="00:15:57.801" end="00:16:00.901" style="s2">and I couldn&#39;t leave.</p>
<p begin="00:15:59.601" end="00:16:02.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And the rose?</p>
<p begin="00:16:00.901" end="00:16:04.801" style="s2">Was that a trick, too?</p>
<p begin="00:16:02.801" end="00:16:06.001" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The rose chose me.</p>
<p begin="00:16:04.801" end="00:16:09.101" style="s2">And you threw it with all your strength</p>
<p begin="00:16:06.001" end="00:16:09.101" style="s2">far away from Victor, didn&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="00:16:12.301" end="00:16:17.901" style="s2">I liked you about my name,</p>
<p begin="00:16:14.701" end="00:16:17.901" style="s2">but never once about what I feel.</p>
<p begin="00:16:18.201" end="00:16:21.302" style="s2">My knights are waiting at the border. At</p>
<p begin="00:16:19.802" end="00:16:25.702" style="s2">the Crown Feast, we enter the palace</p>
<p begin="00:16:21.302" end="00:16:25.702" style="s2">together, you and I, if you accept.</p>
<p begin="00:16:26.602" end="00:16:31.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You said I&#39;d need your hand somewhere.</p>
<p begin="00:16:28.302" end="00:16:31.102" style="s2">This is the place.</p>
<p begin="00:16:36.702" end="00:16:42.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Three days until the Crown Feast. My</p>
<p begin="00:16:38.902" end="00:16:43.402" style="s2">knights wait at the border, here.</p>
<p begin="00:16:42.102" end="00:16:45.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then we must reach them before Victor</p>
<p begin="00:16:43.402" end="00:16:45.902" style="s2">finds us.</p>
<p begin="00:16:48.502" end="00:16:52.102" style="s2">If Lady Morgana learns I was here,</p>
<p begin="00:16:51.002" end="00:16:53.802" style="s2">she will kill me.</p>
<p begin="00:16:52.102" end="00:16:56.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She won&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:16:53.802" end="00:16:56.902" style="s2">You are braver than all of us.</p>
<p begin="00:16:57.226" end="00:16:59.246" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:17:02.402" end="00:17:04.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mira,</p>
<p begin="00:17:03.302" end="00:17:06.102" style="s2">you must go back [music] tonight as if</p>
<p begin="00:17:04.602" end="00:17:08.402" style="s2">nothing happened. Keep the bottle</p>
<p begin="00:17:06.102" end="00:17:08.402" style="s2">hidden.</p>
<p begin="00:17:22.502" end="00:17:27.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The old herb woman in the village knows</p>
<p begin="00:17:24.202" end="00:17:27.202" style="s2">every forest path.</p>
<p begin="00:17:27.702" end="00:17:31.002" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then we go to her at first light.</p>
<p begin="00:17:36.902" end="00:17:41.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Three days. I will open the servants&#39;</p>
<p begin="00:17:39.002" end="00:17:41.202" style="s2">door.</p>
<p begin="00:17:53.802" end="00:17:56.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why didn&#39;t you just leave when you</p>
<p begin="00:17:54.902" end="00:17:58.202" style="s2">learned who I was?</p>
<p begin="00:17:56.802" end="00:17:59.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because I&#39;d already stayed for the wrong</p>
<p begin="00:17:58.202" end="00:18:02.402" style="s2">reason</p>
<p begin="00:17:59.602" end="00:18:02.402" style="s2">and found the right one.</p>
<p begin="00:18:09.277" end="00:18:11.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:18:22.702" end="00:18:25.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where it?</p>
<p begin="00:18:29.582" end="00:18:31.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and panting]</p>
<p begin="00:18:36.303" end="00:18:40.803" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Someone has taken the bottle.</p>
<p begin="00:18:38.103" end="00:18:40.803" style="s2">Find out who.</p>
<p begin="00:18:41.103" end="00:18:44.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Before sunrise, my lady.</p>
<p begin="00:18:47.603" end="00:18:50.603" style="s2">One of you was outside the palace last</p>
<p begin="00:18:49.503" end="00:18:53.503" style="s2">night.</p>
<p begin="00:18:50.603" end="00:18:53.503" style="s2">I will find out who.</p>
<p begin="00:19:03.103" end="00:19:08.103" style="s2">If no one speaks, I will search the</p>
<p begin="00:19:05.003" end="00:19:08.103" style="s2">village at dawn myself.</p>
<p begin="00:19:23.403" end="00:19:26.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I knew you would come back, child.</p>
<p begin="00:19:25.603" end="00:19:29.803" style="s2">We need your help</p>
<p begin="00:19:26.903" end="00:19:29.803" style="s2">and your forest paths.</p>
<p begin="00:19:37.403" end="00:19:41.503" style="s2">If the king is poisoned, three drops of</p>
<p begin="00:19:39.503" end="00:19:43.703" style="s2">this under his tongue.</p>
<p begin="00:19:41.503" end="00:19:47.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How do you know about the poison?</p>
<p begin="00:19:43.703" end="00:19:47.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Old women hear everything, child.</p>
<p begin="00:19:52.703" end="00:19:57.353" style="s2">Follow the old stag path to the river.</p>
<p begin="00:19:55.303" end="00:20:00.503" style="s2">Cross where the three willows stand.</p>
<p begin="00:19:57.353" end="00:20:03.103" style="s2">[music] No soldier knows that ford.</p>
<p begin="00:20:00.503" end="00:20:03.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, mother.</p>
<p begin="00:20:03.203" end="00:20:06.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Soldiers,</p>
<p begin="00:20:04.303" end="00:20:09.903" style="s2">the red commander is in the village.</p>
<p begin="00:20:06.103" end="00:20:09.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The back door. Go now.</p>
<p begin="00:20:22.703" end="00:20:25.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where is the princess? The one who lives</p>
<p begin="00:20:24.405" end="00:20:27.805" style="s2">here with the vagabond.</p>
<p begin="00:20:25.705" end="00:20:28.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No princess here, my lord. Only poor</p>
<p begin="00:20:27.805" end="00:20:31.305" style="s2">folk.</p>
<p begin="00:20:28.605" end="00:20:31.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Search every house.</p>
<p begin="00:20:33.905" end="00:20:36.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re searching our hut.</p>
<p begin="00:20:38.605" end="00:20:42.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then there&#39;s no way back, only forward.</p>
<p begin="00:20:53.605" end="00:20:57.805" style="s2">Nothing here. The commander wants us</p>
<p begin="00:20:55.005" end="00:20:57.805" style="s2">back at the village.</p>
<p begin="00:21:06.705" end="00:21:12.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; From the old woman for the long road.</p>
<p begin="00:21:09.105" end="00:21:12.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She thinks of everything.</p>
<p begin="00:21:19.805" end="00:21:23.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Three willows. This is the ford.</p>
<p begin="00:21:32.605" end="00:21:37.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tell me about Valdira. Is it beautiful?</p>
<p begin="00:21:35.605" end="00:21:38.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mountains, lakes, and a castle on the</p>
<p begin="00:21:37.505" end="00:21:40.805" style="s2">cliffs.</p>
<p begin="00:21:38.905" end="00:21:42.805" style="s2">But it was never home.</p>
<p begin="00:21:40.805" end="00:21:45.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why not?</p>
<p begin="00:21:42.805" end="00:21:45.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because home is not a place.</p>
<p begin="00:21:54.305" end="00:21:59.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You burned it again.</p>
<p begin="00:21:57.605" end="00:22:01.860" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I learned from the best.</p>
<p begin="00:21:59.840" end="00:22:01.860" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:22:04.905" end="00:22:08.205" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When this is over,</p>
<p begin="00:22:06.805" end="00:22:10.705" style="s2">will you still want a girl who throws</p>
<p begin="00:22:08.205" end="00:22:12.105" style="s2">roses at strangers?</p>
<p begin="00:22:10.705" end="00:22:14.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I only want the girl who gave her last</p>
<p begin="00:22:12.105" end="00:22:14.605" style="s2">bread to one.</p>
<p begin="00:22:25.105" end="00:22:29.806" style="s2">There.</p>
<p begin="00:22:26.905" end="00:22:29.806" style="s2">My father&#39;s banners.</p>
<p begin="00:22:30.006" end="00:22:33.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then we&#39;re not alone anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:22:40.506" end="00:22:43.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your Highness,</p>
<p begin="00:22:42.106" end="00:22:45.506" style="s2">we thought you [music] dead.</p>
<p begin="00:22:43.706" end="00:22:48.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not yet, Captain.</p>
<p begin="00:22:45.506" end="00:22:48.706" style="s2">Not while she still needs me.</p>
<p begin="00:22:54.206" end="00:22:57.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lord Victor holds the palace. The king</p>
<p begin="00:22:56.306" end="00:22:58.706" style="s2">has not been seen in days.</p>
<p begin="00:22:57.506" end="00:22:59.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then we ride before the feast of the</p>
<p begin="00:22:58.706" end="00:23:01.306" style="s2">Golden Rose.</p>
<p begin="00:22:59.806" end="00:23:03.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And I know a way in that no guard will</p>
<p begin="00:23:01.306" end="00:23:03.706" style="s2">watch.</p>
<p begin="00:23:06.706" end="00:23:09.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t have to come with me. It will</p>
<p begin="00:23:08.306" end="00:23:11.406" style="s2">be dangerous.</p>
<p begin="00:23:09.506" end="00:23:14.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You came back for me in the village. Now</p>
<p begin="00:23:11.406" end="00:23:14.106" style="s2">I come with you.</p>
<p begin="00:23:19.906" end="00:23:24.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stand aside. I am Rowan, son of your</p>
<p begin="00:23:22.606" end="00:23:24.906" style="s2">king.</p>
<p begin="00:23:25.606" end="00:23:30.906" style="s2">Lord Victor said the prince was dead.</p>
<p begin="00:23:28.006" end="00:23:30.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Does he look dead to you?</p>
<p begin="00:23:38.906" end="00:23:43.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Forgive us, Highness.</p>
<p begin="00:23:40.306" end="00:23:45.006" style="s2">We serve the crown, not Lord Victor.</p>
<p begin="00:23:43.206" end="00:23:48.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then ride with us.</p>
<p begin="00:23:45.006" end="00:23:48.406" style="s2">The king needs every loyal sword.</p>
<p begin="00:23:54.706" end="00:23:58.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How far to the palace?</p>
<p begin="00:23:56.706" end="00:24:00.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Two days ride. [music] We arrive on the</p>
<p begin="00:23:58.506" end="00:24:02.306" style="s2">eve of the feast.</p>
<p begin="00:24:00.306" end="00:24:04.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then Victor won&#39;t see us coming.</p>
<p begin="00:24:02.306" end="00:24:06.306" style="s2">The servants&#39; door by the kitchens.</p>
<p begin="00:24:04.406" end="00:24:08.806" style="s2">My friend Mira works there. She will</p>
<p begin="00:24:06.306" end="00:24:10.906" style="s2">open it at midnight.</p>
<p begin="00:24:08.806" end="00:24:13.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can we trust her?</p>
<p begin="00:24:10.906" end="00:24:13.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; With my life.</p>
<p begin="00:24:21.006" end="00:24:25.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The men are ready, Highness.</p>
<p begin="00:24:22.606" end="00:24:27.106" style="s2">200 swords.</p>
<p begin="00:24:25.206" end="00:24:28.526" style="s2">No battle unless we must.</p>
<p begin="00:24:27.106" end="00:24:28.706" style="s2">We take the palace from within.</p>
<p begin="00:24:28.526" end="00:24:28.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:24:28.706" end="00:24:32.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And we</p>
<p begin="00:24:28.908" end="00:24:32.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; bring the king back to his people.</p>
<p begin="00:24:39.507" end="00:24:43.607" style="s2">What if we are too late for my father?</p>
<p begin="00:24:42.007" end="00:24:47.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We won&#39;t be.</p>
<p begin="00:24:43.607" end="00:24:47.408" style="s2">Tomorrow night the rose comes home.</p>
<p begin="00:24:57.408" end="00:25:01.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Victor doubled the guard.</p>
<p begin="00:24:59.307" end="00:25:03.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Only on the walls. Nobody guards the</p>
<p begin="00:25:01.307" end="00:25:03.807" style="s2">kitchens.</p>
<p begin="00:25:06.607" end="00:25:09.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Highness,</p>
<p begin="00:25:07.707" end="00:25:12.307" style="s2">the guard changes at midnight. For a</p>
<p begin="00:25:09.307" end="00:25:15.207" style="s2">moment the kitchen yard is empty.</p>
<p begin="00:25:12.307" end="00:25:15.207" style="s2">Then midnight it is.</p>
<p begin="00:25:19.807" end="00:25:25.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Rest, your majesty.</p>
<p begin="00:25:21.707" end="00:25:25.007" style="s2">The feast will go on without you.</p>
<p begin="00:25:25.408" end="00:25:30.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where is my daughter, Victor?</p>
<p begin="00:25:28.307" end="00:25:33.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Gone, sire.</p>
<p begin="00:25:30.607" end="00:25:33.607" style="s2">She chose her beggar.</p>
<p begin="00:25:38.707" end="00:25:44.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t drink, your majesty. Your daughter</p>
<p begin="00:25:40.607" end="00:25:44.408" style="s2">is alive. She is coming tomorrow night.</p>
<p begin="00:25:44.707" end="00:25:47.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elena?</p>
<p begin="00:25:49.607" end="00:25:53.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is it done?</p>
<p begin="00:25:51.107" end="00:25:54.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The king grows weaker by the hour. By</p>
<p begin="00:25:53.107" end="00:25:56.107" style="s2">the feast the crown is yours.</p>
<p begin="00:25:54.807" end="00:25:57.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mother,</p>
<p begin="00:25:56.107" end="00:26:00.607" style="s2">is this really necessary?</p>
<p begin="00:25:57.408" end="00:26:00.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hold your tongue, Selida.</p>
<p begin="00:26:08.207" end="00:26:11.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You heard everything, didn&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="00:26:11.707" end="00:26:15.607" style="s2">Then go.</p>
<p begin="00:26:12.707" end="00:26:15.607" style="s2">Tell no one you saw me.</p>
<p begin="00:26:24.007" end="00:26:26.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mira,</p>
<p begin="00:26:25.107" end="00:26:27.908" style="s2">what are you doing here so late?</p>
<p begin="00:26:26.807" end="00:26:30.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just checking the bread for tomorrow&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:26:27.908" end="00:26:30.408" style="s2">feast.</p>
<p begin="00:26:41.509" end="00:26:43.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You came back.</p>
<p begin="00:26:42.509" end="00:26:47.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I promised.</p>
<p begin="00:26:43.809" end="00:26:47.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Quickly, before the guard returns.</p>
<p begin="00:26:52.709" end="00:26:56.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The king knows you&#39;re coming. [music] He</p>
<p begin="00:26:54.209" end="00:26:59.009" style="s2">is waiting for you.</p>
<p begin="00:26:56.009" end="00:26:59.009" style="s2">Then tomorrow we end this.</p>
<p begin="00:26:59.109" end="00:27:02.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve done more than any nightmare.</p>
<p begin="00:27:07.609" end="00:27:11.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tomorrow you&#39;ll serve the wine at the</p>
<p begin="00:27:08.809" end="00:27:14.109" style="s2">feast. Nobody ever looks at servants.</p>
<p begin="00:27:11.709" end="00:27:17.209" style="s2">Then I&#39;ll carry the golden rose myself.</p>
<p begin="00:27:14.109" end="00:27:17.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And I&#39;ll pour Victor&#39;s wine.</p>
<p begin="00:27:22.409" end="00:27:25.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My rose.</p>
<p begin="00:27:24.309" end="00:27:27.209" style="s2">You came home.</p>
<p begin="00:27:25.409" end="00:27:29.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I promised, father.</p>
<p begin="00:27:27.209" end="00:27:30.709" style="s2">Tomorrow you will be free.</p>
<p begin="00:27:29.109" end="00:27:34.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You kept her safe.</p>
<p begin="00:27:30.709" end="00:27:34.009" style="s2">She kept me safe, your majesty.</p>
<p begin="00:27:37.109" end="00:27:40.909" style="s2">Your mother&#39;s rose.</p>
<p begin="00:27:39.109" end="00:27:41.809" style="s2">Wear it tomorrow so they know who you</p>
<p begin="00:27:40.909" end="00:27:43.209" style="s2">are.</p>
<p begin="00:27:41.809" end="00:27:45.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will, father.</p>
<p begin="00:27:43.209" end="00:27:45.709" style="s2">Now rest.</p>
<p begin="00:27:49.009" end="00:27:52.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Torches on the stairs. Someone is</p>
<p begin="00:27:50.609" end="00:27:52.909" style="s2">coming.</p>
<p begin="00:27:55.109" end="00:27:57.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tomorrow, father.</p>
<p begin="00:28:06.409" end="00:28:09.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You seem</p>
<p begin="00:28:07.509" end="00:28:13.309" style="s2">better tonight, your majesty.</p>
<p begin="00:28:09.809" end="00:28:13.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I dreamed of roses, Victor.</p>
<p begin="00:28:24.809" end="00:28:27.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep your head down. Nobody must see</p>
<p begin="00:28:26.309" end="00:28:30.909" style="s2">your face.</p>
<p begin="00:28:27.809" end="00:28:30.909" style="s2">Only until the right moment.</p>
<p begin="00:28:36.410" end="00:28:38.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The musicians needed one more lute</p>
<p begin="00:28:37.610" end="00:28:40.510" style="s2">player.</p>
<p begin="00:28:38.910" end="00:28:41.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can you even play?</p>
<p begin="00:28:40.510" end="00:28:44.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Badly,</p>
<p begin="00:28:41.610" end="00:28:44.110" style="s2">but loudly.</p>
<p begin="00:28:52.410" end="00:28:55.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Here, your proof.</p>
<p begin="00:28:56.310" end="00:28:59.410" style="s2">Tonight everyone will see it.</p>
<p begin="00:29:09.110" end="00:29:14.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When the music stops, come up the</p>
<p begin="00:29:10.910" end="00:29:17.610" style="s2">kitchen stairs, not a moment before.</p>
<p begin="00:29:14.610" end="00:29:17.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ll be ready, Highness.</p>
<p begin="00:29:23.710" end="00:29:27.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; By midnight Salady will be air.</p>
<p begin="00:29:27.410" end="00:29:32.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And by morning the king will sleep</p>
<p begin="00:29:29.710" end="00:29:32.210" style="s2">forever.</p>
<p begin="00:29:40.610" end="00:29:45.810" style="s2">Smile tonight, Selena.</p>
<p begin="00:29:42.910" end="00:29:45.810" style="s2">You&#39;ll be a queen.</p>
<p begin="00:29:51.710" end="00:29:56.510" style="s2">The bottle is gone.</p>
<p begin="00:29:53.810" end="00:29:59.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then someone knows.</p>
<p begin="00:29:56.510" end="00:29:59.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Find them before midnight.</p>
<p begin="00:30:03.310" end="00:30:07.165" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Help me up, Neara.</p>
<p begin="00:30:04.910" end="00:30:09.185" style="s2">Tonight I sit on my throne.</p>
<p begin="00:30:07.165" end="00:30:09.185" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:30:12.510" end="00:30:16.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And tonight you&#39;ll see her again, your</p>
<p begin="00:30:13.710" end="00:30:16.310" style="s2">Majesty.</p>
<p begin="00:30:51.712" end="00:30:55.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mother,</p>
<p begin="00:30:53.012" end="00:30:55.912" style="s2">stay with me tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:31:03.912" end="00:31:08.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Watch the servants. Trust no one</p>
<p begin="00:31:05.812" end="00:31:08.212" style="s2">tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:31:50.002" end="00:31:52.022" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:32:18.212" end="00:32:22.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sign, my love.</p>
<p begin="00:32:20.012" end="00:32:24.712" style="s2">Saliva is your heir, and the kingdom is</p>
<p begin="00:32:22.312" end="00:32:24.712" style="s2">safe.</p>
<p begin="00:32:25.912" end="00:32:28.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop, father!</p>
<p begin="00:32:30.912" end="00:32:36.412" style="s2">The vagabond&#39;s wife, how dare you come</p>
<p begin="00:32:33.312" end="00:32:38.012" style="s2">back? Guards!</p>
<p begin="00:32:36.412" end="00:32:40.513" style="s2">FATHER ISN&#39;T SICK.</p>
<p begin="00:32:38.012" end="00:32:44.613" style="s2">THIS BOTTLE IS Morgana&#39;s chamber. A slow</p>
<p begin="00:32:40.513" end="00:32:44.613" style="s2">poison, a drop every night in his wine.</p>
<p begin="00:32:46.513" end="00:32:49.913" style="s2">Lies.</p>
<p begin="00:32:47.813" end="00:32:52.613" style="s2">A vagabond&#39;s wife wants revenge. Who</p>
<p begin="00:32:49.913" end="00:32:52.613" style="s2">would believe her?</p>
<p begin="00:32:53.613" end="00:32:58.613" style="s2">Then drink.</p>
<p begin="00:32:55.413" end="00:32:58.613" style="s2">Drink from my father&#39;s cup.</p>
<p begin="00:33:09.613" end="00:33:14.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Morgana.</p>
<p begin="00:33:11.613" end="00:33:14.013" style="s2">Why?</p>
<p begin="00:33:15.807" end="00:33:17.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:33:20.113" end="00:33:25.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because I gave you 20 years, and every</p>
<p begin="00:33:23.313" end="00:33:28.313" style="s2">day you looked at the PORTRAIT OF YOUR</p>
<p begin="00:33:25.313" end="00:33:28.313" style="s2">DEAD WIFE.</p>
<p begin="00:33:31.713" end="00:33:36.213" style="s2">VICTOR,</p>
<p begin="00:33:33.413" end="00:33:36.213" style="s2">kill them!</p>
<p begin="00:33:41.353" end="00:33:43.373" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:34:04.013" end="00:34:08.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A vagabond with a sword.</p>
<p begin="00:34:06.313" end="00:34:10.713" style="s2">Where did you steal it?</p>
<p begin="00:34:08.713" end="00:34:13.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; From my father,</p>
<p begin="00:34:10.713" end="00:34:13.813" style="s2">the king of Valdara.</p>
<p begin="00:34:19.343" end="00:34:21.363" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:34:40.304" end="00:34:42.324" style="s2">[cheering]</p>
<p begin="00:35:49.514" end="00:35:52.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your Highness.</p>
<p begin="00:36:06.614" end="00:36:09.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s over, Victor.</p>
<p begin="00:36:21.114" end="00:36:26.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough, mother.</p>
<p begin="00:36:23.214" end="00:36:26.914" style="s2">I don&#39;t want a crown stained with blood.</p>
<p begin="00:36:35.614" end="00:36:39.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; LET GO OF ME. I [screaming] AM A DUKE.</p>
<p begin="00:36:47.375" end="00:36:49.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:36:54.316" end="00:36:58.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It was always yours.</p>
<p begin="00:36:56.216" end="00:36:58.616" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:37:10.516" end="00:37:14.716" style="s2">Father.</p>
<p begin="00:37:11.916" end="00:37:14.716" style="s2">Father, stay with me.</p>
<p begin="00:37:21.416" end="00:37:24.516" style="s2">The old woman in the village said these</p>
<p begin="00:37:22.716" end="00:37:25.416" style="s2">herbs drive out any poison. Drink,</p>
<p begin="00:37:24.516" end="00:37:27.616" style="s2">father.</p>
<p begin="00:37:25.416" end="00:37:27.616" style="s2">Please.</p>
<p begin="00:37:52.916" end="00:37:58.826" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I told you.</p>
<p begin="00:37:54.916" end="00:37:58.826" style="s2">The rose is never wrong. [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:38:07.116" end="00:38:13.116" style="s2">Prince of Valdara,</p>
<p begin="00:38:09.816" end="00:38:15.916" style="s2">you caught my daughter&#39;s rose.</p>
<p begin="00:38:13.116" end="00:38:15.916" style="s2">And she caught my heart.</p>
<p begin="00:38:20.816" end="00:38:26.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Long live the king.</p>
<p begin="00:38:23.616" end="00:38:26.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Long live Princess Elena.</p>
<p begin="00:38:27.591" end="00:38:29.611" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [applause]</p>
<p begin="00:38:37.416" end="00:38:40.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You look beautiful.</p>
<p begin="00:38:41.916" end="00:38:46.216" style="s2">Thank you, Mira.</p>
<p begin="00:38:43.716" end="00:38:46.216" style="s2">For everything.</p>
<p begin="00:38:51.417" end="00:38:55.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your father would be proud of you, your</p>
<p begin="00:38:53.017" end="00:38:55.317" style="s2">Highness.</p>
<p begin="00:38:56.417" end="00:38:59.917" style="s2">Then let us not keep my bride waiting.</p>
<p begin="00:39:06.717" end="00:39:08.917" style="s2">Your mother would have been so proud</p>
<p begin="00:39:08.117" end="00:39:12.217" style="s2">today.</p>
<p begin="00:39:08.917" end="00:39:12.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And I will be happy for both of you.</p>
<p begin="00:39:24.617" end="00:39:27.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I choose you</p>
<p begin="00:39:26.017" end="00:39:29.017" style="s2">in a palace [music] or in a hut.</p>
<p begin="00:39:27.617" end="00:39:30.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And I choose you</p>
<p begin="00:39:29.017" end="00:39:34.317" style="s2">every day.</p>
<p begin="00:39:30.317" end="00:39:34.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are now husband and wife.</p>
<p begin="00:39:38.987" end="00:39:41.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [applause]</p>
<p begin="00:39:46.192" end="00:39:48.212" style="s2">[applause]</p>
<p begin="00:39:51.117" end="00:39:54.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I told you, child, poor in his pocket,</p>
<p begin="00:39:53.517" end="00:39:56.727" style="s2">rich in his heart.</p>
<p begin="00:39:54.707" end="00:39:56.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:40:01.257" end="00:40:03.932" style="s2">[cheering]</p>
<p begin="00:40:01.912" end="00:40:03.932" style="s2">[applause]</p>
<p begin="00:40:06.517" end="00:40:09.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look, Rowan,</p>
<p begin="00:40:07.817" end="00:40:11.317" style="s2">the whole kingdom came.</p>
<p begin="00:40:09.917" end="00:40:13.047" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not for me,</p>
<p begin="00:40:11.317" end="00:40:15.067" style="s2">for you.</p>
<p begin="00:40:13.047" end="00:40:15.067" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [cheering]</p>
<p begin="00:40:15.917" end="00:40:19.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; People of Altania,</p>
<p begin="00:40:17.817" end="00:40:21.917" style="s2">my daughter married a man we took for a</p>
<p begin="00:40:19.717" end="00:40:25.317" style="s2">vagabond, and he was the only one among</p>
<p begin="00:40:21.917" end="00:40:25.317" style="s2">us who was never poor.</p>
<p begin="00:40:34.717" end="00:40:38.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you regret the hut and the burnt</p>
<p begin="00:40:36.017" end="00:40:38.317" style="s2">bread?</p>
<p begin="00:40:38.617" end="00:40:42.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They were the happiest [music] days of</p>
<p begin="00:40:39.617" end="00:40:42.117" style="s2">my life.</p>
<p begin="00:40:45.798" end="00:40:50.718" style="s2">[laughter] Whoever catches the Golden</p>
<p begin="00:40:47.618" end="00:40:50.718" style="s2">rose is next.</p>
<p begin="00:41:00.863" end="00:41:02.883" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [cheering]</p>
<p begin="00:41:08.618" end="00:41:12.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh no, NOT ME.</p>
<p begin="00:41:22.918" end="00:41:25.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THEY SAID THE ROSE FELL INTO THE WRONG</p>
<p begin="00:41:24.518" end="00:41:27.518" style="s2">HAND,</p>
<p begin="00:41:25.818" end="00:41:31.118" style="s2">but it was the only hand that gave its</p>
<p begin="00:41:27.518" end="00:41:31.118" style="s2">last bread to a stranger.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
